 of the capsular polysaccharide from culture supernatant of Haemophilus influenzae type b</article-title><source>Infect Immun</source><year>1977</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>472</fpage><lpage>477</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">300361</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lemercinier</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An NMR spectroscopic identity test for the control of the capsular polysaccharide from Haemophilus influenzae type b</article-title><source>Biologicals</source><year>2000</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>175</fpage><lpage>183</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10964444</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/biol.2000.0255</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>